          {
            "title": "Question: del",
            "id": 96242,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang akan dicetak oleh kode berikut?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"side = \" /><text value=\"&quot;salad&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"meal = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Steak&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Chips&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", side]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" meal[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(side)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"salad\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>salad</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada, error akan ditampilkan</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>chips</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>salad</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setelah <code>del meal[-1]</code> dijalankan, pernyataan mana yang menjelaskan <code>meal</code> dan <code>side</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"side = \" /><text value=\"&quot;salad&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"meal = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Steak&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Chips&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", side]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" meal[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(side)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"salad\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">meal tidak lagi berisi salad, tetapi side tetap menyimpan salad</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">meal dan side sama-sama kehilangan nilai salad</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">meal tetap berisi salad karena side menyimpan nilai yang sama</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">meal tidak lagi berisi salad, tetapi side tetap menyimpan salad.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: del list item",
            "id": 96244,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gunakan <code>del</code> untuk menghapus item terakhir dalam <code>shopping</code> jika list tersebut memiliki lebih dari 3 item.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shopping = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;bananas&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;oranges&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;lemons&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;carrots&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;beans&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" len(shopping) &gt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" shopping[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(shopping)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"104\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['bananas', 'oranges', 'lemons', 'carrots']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>del shopping[-1]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: del uses",
            "id": 96247,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>del</code> dapat digunakan untuk menghapus yang mana dari berikut ini?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Referensi objek apa pun, termasuk item di dalam struktur data</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hanya bagian dari sebuah list</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Hanya pasangan key:value dalam dictionary</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Referensi objek apa pun, termasuk item di dalam struktur data.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>del</code> dapat menghapus referensi objek, termasuk item di dalam struktur data.</p><p>Jika <code>scores</code> menyimpan list, pasangan mana yang keduanya dapat menjadi target valid untuk <code>del</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">scores dan scores[0]</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hanya scores[0], karena variabel tidak dapat dihapus</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Hanya scores, karena item list tidak dapat dihapus</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih scores dan scores[0].</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: del object",
            "id": 96245,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi kode agar <code>cookies</code> dihapus jika item terakhir dalam tuple <code>permissions</code> adalah <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cookies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;site_access&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;adverts&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"permissions = (\" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" permissions[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] == \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cookies\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Cookies deleted&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"delete\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Cookies deleted\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>-</code>, diikuti oleh <code>1</code>, lalu <code>del</code>, <code>cookies</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hapus <code>cookies</code> ketika item <strong>terakhir</strong> dalam tuple <code>permissions</code> adalah <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cookies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;site_access&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;adverts&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"permissions = (\" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" permissions[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] == \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cookies\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Cookies deleted&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"delete\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Cookies deleted\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>-</code>, diikuti oleh <code>1</code>, <code>==</code>, <code>del</code>, dan terakhir <code>cookies</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: clean dict",
            "id": 96246,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi kode untuk menghapus <code>Jason</code> dari dictionary <code>users</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;Dave&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": (\" /><text value=\"27\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Manager&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"),\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"         \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alexis&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": (\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;CEO&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"),\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"         \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": (\" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Apprentice&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" users[\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"122\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Alexis&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"keys\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'Dave': (27, 'Manager'), 'Alexis': (33, 'CEO')}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>del</code>, diikuti oleh <code>users</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"Jason\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hapus pengguna dengan role <code>Apprentice</code> dari dictionary.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;Dave&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": (\" /><text value=\"27\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Manager&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"),\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"         \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alexis&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": (\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;CEO&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"),\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"         \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": (\" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Apprentice&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" users[\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"122\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Alexis&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"keys\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'Dave': (27, 'Manager'), 'Alexis': (33, 'CEO')}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>del</code>, diikuti oleh <code>users</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"Jason\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: negative stepping",
            "id": 96337,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi kode agar <code>[\"H\", \"e\", \"l\", \"l\", \"o\"]</code> dicetak.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scrambled = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;X&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;y&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;o&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;e&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;l&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;5&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;l&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;a&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;e&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;f&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;H&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;z&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hello = scrambled[\" /><text value=\"-2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"-2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(hello)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['H', 'e', 'l', 'l', 'o']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>2</code>, diikuti oleh <code>-</code>, dan terakhir <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mulai di <code>H</code> dengan indeks negatif. Berhenti sebelum indeks <code>2</code> dan mundur dua langkah untuk mencetak <code>[\"H\", \"e\", \"l\", \"l\", \"o\"]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scrambled = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;X&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;y&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;o&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;e&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;l&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;5&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;l&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;a&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;e&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;f&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;H&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;z&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hello = scrambled[\" /><text value=\"-2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"-2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(hello)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['H', 'e', 'l', 'l', 'o']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>-2</code>, diikuti oleh <code>2</code>, <code>-</code>, dan terakhir <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: start values",
            "id": 96330,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Suhu mana yang akan dicetak?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(temperatures[\" /><text value=\"-5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":])\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[14, 16, 17, 12, 11]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Semuanya</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada - error akan ditampilkan</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Semua kecuali yang pertama</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Semuanya.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ekspresi mana yang menghasilkan hanya dua suhu terakhir, <code>[12, 11]</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(temperatures[\" /><text value=\"-5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":])\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[14, 16, 17, 12, 11]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>temperatures[-2:]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>temperatures[2:]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>temperatures[-2]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>temperatures[-2:]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: stop values",
            "id": 96332,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Manakah dari pernyataan berikut yang benar tentang nilai untuk <code>end</code>.</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>end</code> bisa berupa bilangan bulat apa pun, positif atau negatif</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nilai <code>end</code> harus selalu disertakan</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nilai <code>end</code> harus lebih besar daripada nilai <code>start</code> agar tidak terjadi error</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>end</code> bisa berupa bilangan bulat apa pun, positif atau negatif.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>end</code> sebuah slice dapat berupa integer positif atau negatif dan juga dapat dihilangkan.</p><p>Dalam <code>letters[1:-1]</code>, apa yang dilakukan oleh <code>-1</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Menandai posisi terakhir sebagai end yang tidak disertakan</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Membuat slice tidak valid karena end negatif</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Membalik slice secara otomatis</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Menandai posisi terakhir sebagai end yang tidak disertakan.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: start:stop:step",
            "id": 96339,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Huruf mana yang akan dicetak oleh kode berikut?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"alphabet = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;B&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;C&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"selection = alphabet[\" /><text value=\"-2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(selection)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['B']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"> hanya <code>B</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada yang akan dicetak</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>A</code> dan <code>B</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"> hanya <code>B</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Output di bawah ini untuk slice seperti yang tertulis. Apa yang akan disimpan <code>selection</code> jika slice-nya menjadi <code>alphabet[-2:-1:-1]</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"alphabet = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;B&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;C&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"selection = alphabet[\" /><text value=\"-2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(selection)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['B']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">List kosong</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>['B']</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>['B', 'A']</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih List kosong.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: negative stepping",
            "id": 96340,
